<title>USA: TIG Holdings adds to share buyback plan.</title>
<headline>TIG Holdings adds to share buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>TIG Holdings Inc said on Thursday its board had authorized an increase in its stock buyback program by 1.25 million for a total of 11.25 million shares.</p>
<p>The original authorization was announced in March 1994 and has been followed by subsequent increases, the company said.</p>
<p>TIG said it had purchased 9,058,300 shares to date or 14.2 percent of its stock since the program started, TIG said.</p>
<p>TIG Holdings presently has 55.5 million shares outstanding, net of treasury shares.</p>
